          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Disharmonious Decay"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(poison)\n\nWhen a spawn dies, its foulness seeps into the land in a 100-foot radius. Non-magical plant life in the area decays within 1 hour, and new non-magical growth can't sprout for 1 month. A creature can act on the spawn's corpse within 1 minute of its death to limit this decay to a 10-foot square by succeeding at a 22 Medicine, Nature, or Occultism check."
